  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The traditional weapons of the elves are ever your faithful friends in battle.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Elven Battle Training<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your bonus to CMD against disarm and sunder maneuvers increases to +4, and this bonus also applies to your CMD against steal combat maneuvers against any of the listed weapons you are wearing or carrying, and to any saving throws that those weapons must make against attacks or effects that specifically affect them. You may also choose one of the listed weapons in which you are proficient; you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your AC against attacks made with that weapon.</p>\n<p>If you expend one use of mythic power, this circumstance bonus to AC applies to attacks made with all of the listed weapons for a number of rounds equal to tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc105\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
